// Title: Disable Windows IIS HTTP Logging
// ID: e4ed6030-ffe5-4e6a-8a8a-ab3c1ab9d94e
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-01-09
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.001
// Description: Disables HTTP logging on a Windows IIS web server as seen by Threat Group 3390 (Bronze Union)
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "set") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "config") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "section:httplogging") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "dontLog:true"))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\appcmd.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "appcmd.exe"))))
